Commit:     totalwindupflightsystems <totalwindupflightsystems@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Tue Oct 6 18:38:26 2026 -0500

    perf(cli): prefer precompiled dist entry, lazy-load S3 subtree (PERF-004)
    
    bin/duckbrain.js now serves dist/bin/duckbrain.js (tsc -p tsconfig.build.json,
    script build:cli) when present, falling back to tsx with a stderr hint for dev
    mode. Read-only CLI paths no longer load @aws-sdk/client-s3: the SDK-touching
    imports in git/autocommit, s3/sync, namespaces/lifecycle and cli/human are
    deferred to the functions/commands that need them (require-with-import-
    fallback loaders, so vitest's TS transform still resolves them). Also fixes
    the dist-path --version regression by walking up from __dirname to the
    duckbrain package.json.
    
    Evidence: /tmp/perf004-probe.js Module._load hook reports AWS_SDK_LOADS=0 on
    the read-only status path; node bin/duckbrain.js status 0.32-0.34s; full
    vitest suite 205 files / 1658 tests green (one flaky live-/proc process-table
    assertion passes on rerun, env-related not change-related).
    Addresses PERF-004.
    
    ch:trace row=PERF-004 evidence=/tmp/perf004-probe.js
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
